  m_text: 'Ready to join our mission? Ask a cashier today and sign up for your EverGreen
    Card, which will grant you 30% or more off of select purchases on select Tuesdays.
    For more ways to share the love, use our "Search For Store" button to find your
    local EverGreen!


    Shop local, shop global. EverGreen.'
