      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'EverGreen Goods is dedicated to bringing you, our community, the best
    of local and global produce to enrich your lives and help you give back to your
    people. That''s why we partner with local farmers to package, transport, and
    sell their goods to make sure that your money is not only going back to your
    local community, but it''s supporting local communities around the United States.
    To enchance our local/global mission, we''re looking to be a part-time part-co-op
    by 2010! '
